# Shared modules

Packages in `shared_modules/nuc_*` — absorbed into monorepo (not git submodules).

Barrel: `shared_modules/index.ts`
Plugin registration (web): `web/src/plugins/modules.ts` → `registerNuc*(app)`
API gateway: `shared_modules/nuc_api/supabase/api/gateway_dispatch.ts`

## Module structure

```
shared_modules/nuc_example/
├── config.json
├── nuc_example.ts      # Vue plugin
├── index.ts            # Vue barrel
├── _index.scss
├── supabase/api/       # handle.ts, *_handlers.ts
├── supabase/migrations/
├── supabase/seeders/
├── constants/
├── types/
├── utils/
└── vitests/
```

## Import rules

- Inside a module: relative imports only
- Do not import from app packages (`web`, `admin`, `docs`)
- Public surface via `index.ts` and `shared_modules/index.ts`
- Do not import `from 'nucleify'` inside modules (circular)
